    SCM sources. Git and GitHub sources contribute to the count; Files sources
    contribute zero. For a source never indexed, count all tracked files.
    Include files that are ineligible for indexing or headlines.

    Require clean checkouts on the registered branches. Each indexed commit
    must be an ancestor of HEAD. Resolve source folders relative to the
    current workspace.

    Raise [Failure] with the source identity if measurement fails. Leave
    documents and indexed commits unchanged. *)

